  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance for seven observations are <math><mn>8</mn></math> and <math><mn>16</mn></math> respectively. If <math><mn>5</mn></math> of the observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the product of the remaining two observations is",
